<div class="container page"><div class="section-heading"><span>ABOUT</span><h1>About LifeDrop</h1><p>A beginner-friendly blood donation and blood bank management project.</p></div>
<div class="content-card"><h2>Purpose</h2><p>LifeDrop demonstrates how a Python web backend, SQLite database, HTML/CSS frontend and simple JSON APIs can work together.</p><h2>Important</h2><p>This is an educational application. Real blood availability, donor eligibility, medical decisions and emergency coordination should always be handled by qualified healthcare professionals and authorized blood banks.</p></div></div>

